  "description": "Crossette is an adventure structure in Mango Yellow and Cherry Red built for children who like to keep moving. Net bridges, a wavy rope bridge and a crawl tunnel link its climbers, and a slide gives the way down. Each crossing is a different challenge, so children choose their own path. The structure takes 30 to 35 children. It covers 29'6\" x 26'5\", with a safe play area of 34'6\" x 31'5\". The listed skills are emotional intelligence, leadership and self-directed play. It belongs to our NexLev Escapade series and suits parks, societies and school grounds with a near-square space. Our 3-year warranty applies to its galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, laminates and play rope. Ask us for a layout drawing.",
